  "title": "RPM Ep. 61 | Beyond top quartile: what deal-level benchmarking unlocks for private market investors",
  "summary": "Private markets have long had a benchmarking problem — not just a data problem, but a credibility problem. “Top quartile” has been more art than science: fragmented data, inconsistent definitions, and months-long reporting lags make it difficult for GPs to demonstrate how they created value, or for LPs to evaluate managers on a true apples-to-apples […] The post RPM Ep. 61 | Beyond top quartile: what deal-level benchmarking unlocks for private market investors appeared first on StepStone Group .",
